<title>USA: TABLE-Fine Host Corp Q2 shr rises to $0.14.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fine Host Corp Q2 shr rises to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, CT. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,252			250</p>
<p> Net sales		 53,392		   25,803</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,226		    3,713</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS ended June 25</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			  2,100			509</p>
<p> Net sales		102,844		   49,693</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,634		    3,575</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said the earnings per share are before warrant accretion.</p>
<p>The company reported income from operations of $2.5 million compared to $1.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said sales growth for the quarter was the result of a balance between renewal of existing accounts and new contract sales, as wee as its acquisitions in 1996 and early 1997.</p>
